                                                "sense_id": "7a6ebf59-d6ed-354e-8f2d-11cd3f5813db",
                                                "text": "The agent took them to the property for a viewing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48a0f9b2-9660-42d9-83ad-be45c45effd3",
                                                "sense_id": "7a6ebf59-d6ed-354e-8f2d-11cd3f5813db",
                                                "text": "I hated the film at first, but with subsequent viewings it has grown on me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e86be0d-e596-4d26-8fb1-77b6e1112be0",
                                                "sense_id": "7a6ebf59-d6ed-354e-8f2d-11cd3f5813db",
                                                "text": "A complicated interplay of lookings and viewings is in play. The staging and performance of the photograph, then, is as much the subject of the photograph as the ostensible subjects […]"
